title: Rebecca Burgess
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
url: https://fibershed.org/history/

Executive Director of [[Fibershed]].

In 2011 she set out to wear only clothing "made only from materials grown, woven, and sewn in her local area of North Central California."

Fibershed's own history says that project introduced the concept of a fibershed. The nonprofit followed in 2013.

So she is where the word comes from, or at least where they say it does.

See [[Materialshed]], [[Foodshed]], [[BioRegion]]
